      <p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.7;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);max-width:540px;margin:0 0 28px;">Kaduna plants run steam turbine drives, compressor trains and standby generation that has to survive harmattan dust, high dry season ambients and an unreliable grid. We overhaul, test and hand that equipment back inside an agreed outage window.</p>
      <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:16px;">
