<section style="padding:72px 24px 40px;"><div style="max-width:860px;margin:0 auto;"><div class="rich"><p>Kaduna is the industrial anchor of northern Nigeria, and the installed equipment base reflects that history. Steam turbine drives and compressor trains sit in the refining and petrochemical complex on the southern side of the city, boiler houses and process drives survive from the textile era, and almost every mill, factory, hospital and commercial site around the Kakuri and Kudenda industrial areas carries standby generation. Much of that plant is old, well built and still serviceable, provided somebody inspects it on a schedule instead of after it trips.</p><p>Axiom Power Services covers Kaduna State from our Lagos base with <a href="/steam-turbine-overhaul-nigeria/">steam turbine overhaul</a>, gas turbine inspection, <a href="/generator-maintenance-nigeria/">industrial generator maintenance</a> and <a href="/rotating-equipment-services-nigeria/">rotating equipment services</a>. We do not price an overhaul off a phone call. Work starts with measurement: vibration signatures, lube oil condition, alignment and thermal growth records, run hours since the last hot gas path or major inspection, and the condition of the governor and trip system. That produces a scope your procurement team can compare line by line, with spares lead times stated separately from labour.</p></div></div></section>
<section style="padding:0 24px 64px;"><div style="max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;">
    <span class="kicker">What We Do in Kaduna</span>
    <h2 class="section-heading" style="font-size:clamp(22px,3vw,32px);margin:0 0 28px;">Services for Kaduna Plants</h2>
    <div class="feat-grid" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:20px;">
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #e3ded4;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(14,77,110,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Nunito Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#0A3D5C;margin:0 0 8px;">Steam turbine overhaul and rotor services</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Kaduna's refining, petrochemical and process plants depend on back pressure and condensing turbines driving pumps, blowers and compressors, often with no OEM support left behind them. We cover rotor removal, blade and diaphragm inspection, gland and seal renewal, bearing changeout, dynamic balancing, lube oil flushing to a stated cleanliness class, and overspeed trip testing before handback.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #e3ded4;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(14,77,110,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Nunito Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#0A3D5C;margin:0 0 8px;">Gas turbine inspection and hot section work</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Dust loading across Kaduna during harmattan drives inlet filter differential pressure and compressor fouling well past anything a coastal duty cycle would predict. We carry out borescope inspections, combustion and hot gas path work, inlet filtration upgrades, and online and offline compressor washing tied to your own run hours and performance trend rather than a generic calendar.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #e3ded4;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(14,77,110,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Nunito Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#0A3D5C;margin:0 0 8px;">Industrial generator maintenance and load testing</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Grid supply in Kaduna State makes standby and prime rated sets a production asset rather than an emergency item, and most failures show up as fuel, cooling or excitation problems long before the engine itself is at fault. We service sets from 100 kVA upward, covering AVR and governor faults, insulation resistance and polarisation index testing on windings, fuel polishing and tank cleaning, cooling system work and resistive load bank testing at site.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #e3ded4;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(14,77,110,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Nunito Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#0A3D5C;margin:0 0 8px;">Rotating equipment, alignment and vibration analysis</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Pumps, fans, centrifugal and reciprocating compressors and gearboxes across Kaduna's mills, process plants and fabrication shops usually fail at the coupling, the bearing or the seal, not at the driver. We provide laser shaft alignment with thermal growth compensation, vibration analysis against ISO 20816 velocity bands, in situ and workshop dynamic balancing, and mechanical seal replacement.</p>
      </div>
</div>
<style>
